    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "TEAL•\nAIR NEW TEALAND",
      "CHRISTCHURCH, N.Z. A DC8 of Air New Zealand on the\ntarmac at Christchurch International Airport.\nThe DC8\nfanjet, a medium-long range airliner, is among the most\nversatile and well equipped aircraft in commercial use.\nhas a cruising speed of 600 mph. A flight over the South-\nAlps is a feature of the Trans-Tasman section from\nChristchurch.\nPHOTOGRAPHY: GLADYS M. GOODALL.\nColourchrome Series\nW.T. 746\nPRINTED BY WHITCOMBE AND TOMBS LTD.\nFOR THE FELICITY CARD CO. LTD."
    ],
